# Premium UX toolkit

Extend Rinse's design system — do **not** replace it with Radix/Shadcn/cva.

## Allowed packages (behavior only)

| Package | Wave | Owner |
|---------|------|-------|
| `motion-number` | A | `@/components/ui/CurrencyAmount` (`counter` archetype) |
| `nextjs-toploader` | A | `AppShell.tsx` (operator routes only) |
| `use-debounce` | A | `@/hooks/useDebouncedSearch` (300ms) |
| `zod`, `react-hook-form`, `@hookform/resolvers` | B | Form validation behind existing `f-*` chrome |
| `libphonenumber-js` | B | `FloatingAffixField` / phone fields |
| `@tanstack/react-virtual` | B | Long lists (>50) — invoices, clients, jobs |
| `@hello-pangea/dnd` | C | Line-item reorder (pin exact version) |
| `qrcode.react` | C | `@/components/ui/QrCode` or isolated owner |
| `react-day-picker` v9 | C | Booking + operator schedule calendars |
| `@tailwindcss/typography` | C | `.rinse-prose` custom class |

## Forbidden

Radix, Shadcn, `cva`, `tailwindcss-animate`, Sonner, Lucide as primary icons, new bottom-sheet libs, `cmdk`, signature rewrite, Tesseract, `react-to-print`, contacts API.

## Pattern owners (Wave A)

| Pattern | Owner |
|---------|-------|
| Skeleton shimmer + blocks | `components.css` `.skeleton*` |
| Screen loading shells | `@/components/ui/ScreenLoading` + `ScreenSkeletons` |
| Rolling money totals | `@/components/ui/CurrencyAmount` + `MOTION_SPEC.md` `counter` |
| Route progress bar | `AppShell.tsx` + `globals.css` `#nprogress` overrides |
| Search debounce | `@/hooks/useDebouncedSearch` (300ms) |

## Rules

1. **Two lanes:** operator `--bg-*` / `--green`; client `/book`, `/portal` → `--cl-*` only.
2. **Forms:** keep `FloatingField`, `BottomSheet`, `SheetSubmitButton` — validation wires in, chrome stays.
3. **Motion:** extend archetypes in `MOTION_SPEC.md`; every animation needs `prefers-reduced-motion` + `useReducedMotion` where applicable.
4. **Haptics:** `@/lib/haptics` only.
5. **Writes:** optimistic UI composes with `@/lib/api` + offline-queue — no parallel paths.
6. **Docs:** update `ui-css-audit.md`, `MOTION_SPEC.md`, `STYLE_PLAN.md` when adding a **new shared owner**; skip for one-off uses of existing owners.
7. **Smallest diff:** no drive-by refactors, no per-page animation CSS files.

## Hands-off

Auth logic, PocketBase schema, PDF layout structure, Stripe integration — visual/UX/interaction only.
